### Configuration Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Initialize or Resume Chat Session (Guest)
# @name initChatGuest
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/init
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": ""
}

### 2. Initialize or Resume Chat Session (Mock Customer John Doe)
# @name initChatIdentified
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/init
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "5511999999999"
}

### 3. Send Message - Greeting Intent
# @name sendGreeting
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "5511999999999",
    "text": "Olá, bom dia!"
}

### 4. Send Message - Technical Support + Secondary Request (Invoice)
# @name sendSupportWithInvoiceRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "5511999999999",
    "text": "O sistema caiu de novo. Aproveitando, vocês podem me mandar a segunda via da fatura deste mês?"
}

### 5. Send Message - Plan Pricing Inquiry
# @name sendPricingInquiry
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "5511999999999",
    "text": "Quais são os planos e preços disponíveis para upgrade?"
}

### 6. Send Message - Financial Inquiry
# @name sendFinancialInquiry
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "5511999999999",
    "text": "Gostaria de consultar minhas faturas e extrato de pagamentos."
}

### 7. Send Message - Guest Customer Providing Phone Authentication
# @name sendGuestAuthentication
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "guest_123456",
    "text": "Meu telefone cadastrado é 5511999999999"
}

### 8. Get Chat History for Customer
# @name getChatHistory
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/history?customerId=5511999999999

### 9. Get Available Providers and Active Model
# @name getProviders
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/providers

### 10. Switch Active Provider (e.g. to Gemini or Ollama)
# @name switchProvider
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/providers/switch
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "providerId": "gemini",
    "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
}

### 11. Reset Customer Chat Session
# @name resetChatSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/reset
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "5511999999999"
}

### 12. Send Message - Plan Consultation
# @name sendPlanConsultation
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "5511999999999",
    "text": "Qual é o meu plano atual?"
}

### 13. Send Message - Plan Change Request (Target: Mais barato)
# @name sendPlanChangeRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "5511999999999",
    "text": "Quero mudar para o plano mais barato"
}

### 14. Send Message - Confirm Plan Change
# @name sendConfirmPlanChange
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "5511999999999",
    "text": "Sim, confirmo a mudança"
}

### 15. Send Message - Address Change Request
# @name sendAddressChangeRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "5511999999999",
    "text": "Mudei de casa para Rua das Acácias, 450"
}

### 16. Send Message - Confirm Address Change
# @name sendConfirmAddressChange
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "5511999999999",
    "text": "Sim, confirmar endereço"
}

### 17. Send Message - Informal / Slang Technical Support
# @name sendInformalSupport
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "5511999999999",
    "text": "e ae meu bom, o modem ta piscano vermelho e nao entra net"
}

### 18. Send Message - Out of Flow Request (Triggers smart alternative options)
# @name sendOutOfFlowFallback
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "5511999999999",
    "text": "vocês vendem pão de queijo quentinho?"
}

